  "description": "Virtual Reality Survival Game \"Merciless\"\n\nSomewhere, cameras are rolling,\nand those who put their faces on a broadcast for money are forced to either kill or be killed. Standing at a crossroads of choice.\n\n\"It feels uncomfortably real, like I've actually killed someone...\"\n\nA brutal world where everyone must kill each other.\nA person who had been living an ordinary life...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63085282), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%A8%B8%EC%8B%A4%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4/3886)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/163421)",
